# Elasticsearch REST API (local compose, security off). Kafka has no HTTP API: see docs/HOW-TO-RUN.md.
@es = http://localhost:9200

### Cluster health (single node: green until an index has replicas, then yellow)
GET {{es}}/_cluster/health

?? status == 200
?? js ["green", "yellow"].includes(response.parsedBody.status)

### Version (must be 8.x; the search-service client is pinned to 8.19)
GET {{es}}/

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.version.number.startsWith("8.")

### All indices with doc counts and size
GET {{es}}/_cat/indices?v&s=index

?? status == 200
